  "steps": [
    "In a pan, add butter and pepper. Then add garlic and onion. Sauté until golden brown.",
    "Add all the green vegetables and saute for 3-4 minutes.",
    "Then add soaked almonds, salt and water. Give it a mix and cover and cook for 10-15 mins until everything is tender.",
    "Once it cools down, blend it into a fine puree. At this stage you can also add 1/4th cup of coconut milk if you are into rich and super creamy soups.",
    "Add some butter and chilli oil to the pan and pour this puree back into the pan. Add more water to adjust the consistency if needed and let it come to a bowl.",
    "Optionally garnish with fried garlic flakes, melted butter and chilli oil."
